    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「血筋ですわね。いまとなっては、丸くなっていますけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「おばあさまがそのことを教えてくれて……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「わたしがかつて、君咲学院から『彼女』を追い出すことになってしまったときに、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「たとえ青春時代をともに過ごせなくとも、また一緒に笑いあえる日が来るって、言ってくれたんですのよ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「おばあさまも、犬猿の仲だったゆゆさんのおばあさまと一緒に、笑いあえる日が来たんですもの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「だから、きっと大丈夫だって……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
